        "treatment": "Miticide spray. Introduce predatory mites. Neem oil application.",
        "prevention": "Monitor during dry season. Maintain plant vigor. Avoid dusty conditions.",
        "published": true,
        "updated_at": "2026-10-03T00:57:04.635625+00:00"
